    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Nations that fail to acknowledge the importance of early childhood care and development are faced with an ever-growing burden of health, behavioural and educational problems in later years. Early brain development casts profound influences on the cognition, behaviour and health of an individual and generally that of the population. Poor nutrition for the mother, foetus and infant, and its implications in the first few years of the child's life cannot be reversed by any remedial measures.",
